SUMMARY:River Town Retro Fest at Columbia Market House
DESCRIPTION:Fall Events: Music\, Vintage Finds & Riverfront Fun\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRecord Revolution – Vinyl Show\n\n\n\n\nSaturday\, October 3rd\n9:00 AM–3:00 PM \nGet ready to dig through stacks of music and discover something special at Record Revolution @ the Columbia Market House! Whether you’re a lifelong vinyl collector\, a cassette enthusiast\, a CD hunter\, or simply looking for a great new soundtrack\, you’ll find plenty to explore. Browse vinyl records\, cassettes\, CDs\, music merchandise\, collectibles\, and more from a variety of vendors. \nLocated along the Susquehanna River\, Columbia is a charming Lancaster County town known for its rich history\, beautiful riverfront views\, local shops\, and the welcoming atmosphere of its historic Market House. Make a day of it by exploring the market\, visiting its established vendors\, grabbing something delicious to eat\, and soaking up the character of this unique riverside community. \nCome for the music\, stay for the market! Record Revolution is the perfect fall Saturday destination for collectors\, music lovers\, treasure hunters\, and anyone who enjoys the thrill of finding that unexpected gem.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/retro-fest-columbia-market-house/
LOCATION:Columbia Historic Market House\, 15 S Third St\, PA\, United States
CATEGORIES:Columbia PA,Community Interest,Fairs & Festivals,Food & Beverage Events,Market,River Towns
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/columbia-event-retro-fest.png
GEO:39.9496157;-75.1454911
