UID:10053553-1791018000-1791046800@lancasterpa.com
SUMMARY:Lititz Outdoor Fine Art Show
DESCRIPTION:For over 50 years\, the Lititz Outdoor Fine Art Show has been a hallmark of quality and creativity in Lancaster County. As we look toward the future\, the Lititz Art Association is excited to announce some major updates for the 2026 showcase! \nTo provide the best possible experience for artists and visitors alike\, they are moving this beloved event to a brand-new season and a fresh location. \nWhat’s New for 2026?\n\n\nA Shift to Autumn: We are moving from the heat of late July to the crisp\, inspiring air of Fall. \n\n\nA New Setting: While we’ve loved our time in the park\, this year’s show will move to a new location to better accommodate our growing community of art lovers. \n\n\nMoravian Church Square – 8 Church Square\, Lititz\nDate: Saturday\, October 3rd Time: 9AM – 5PM\n\nThe Finest Art in the Region\nDespite the change in scenery and season\, the commitment to “Fine Art” remains unchanged. This show continues its legacy as one of the few strictly fine art exhibitions in the area\, featuring original works and high-quality reproductions from over 130 local and out-of-state artists. \nExplore a Gallery Without Walls\nStroll through the booths of incredibly talented creators and find the perfect addition to your collection. The show features a diverse range of mediums\, including: \n\n\nPaints: Vibrant Oils\, Acrylics\, and delicate Watercolors. \n\n\nDimension: Professional Ceramics and Sculptures. \n\n\nDetail: Intricate Drawings and Mixed Media. \n\n\nThe volunteers of the Lititz Art Association are proud to continue this 50-year tradition in its new home. We invite you to join us this Fall to experience why this show remains one of the town’s most recognizable and prestigious “brand names.”
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/lititz-outdoor-fine-art-show/
LOCATION:Moravian Church Square\, 8 Church Square\, Lititz\, 17543\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Craft Shows,Autumn,Community Interest,Food & Beverage Events,Lititz, PA,Outdoor Activities
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lititz-event-lititz-art-show.webp
END:VEVENT
