SUMMARY:Live Music with Jake Mach at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us on select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nBorn and raised in Glen Rock\, PA\, Navy veteran Jake Mach is a CPMA- and JMA-nominated singer-songwriter. With a soulful voice perfectly suited for storytelling\, Mach writes in a variety of styles across the spectrum of country music. \nJake has performed multiple times at the world famous Bluebird Cafe in Nashville\, TN\, and has opened for Nashville recording artists such as Dillon Carmichael and Shane Profitt. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
