BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/gross-science-lancaster-parks-200919"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Gross Science with Lancaster Parks
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T140000
UID:5780f4ac611b5cac4563db737d732c8d@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Children\n\n🧪 Gross Science (Ages 8–10)Get ready t
 o get gross\, gooey\, slimy\, and scientific! Presented by the Lancaster C
 ounty Parks and Recreation Department\, Gross Science gives young scientis
 ts the chance to explore chemistry through hands-on experiments that are a
 s exciting as they are messy.Participants will discover what happens when 
 science gets a little sizzle\, boom\, and slime! Through engaging experime
 nts and activities\, children will explore scientific reactions\, make obs
 ervations\, and have fun discovering the science behind some wonderfully g
 ross results.Come prepared to experiment\, explore\, and get a little mess
 y!Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, September 16th for Manhe
 im Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, September 23rd 
 for residents of other municipalities.Drop Off Program – This program 
 is intended for children over the age of 8 years who can participate indep
 endently. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth services s
 taff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space.  D
 esignated Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on y
 our registration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.  (
 Ages 8-10)No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for m
 ore than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering
  for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel you
 r registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allo
 w those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration
  status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the sta
 rt of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The progra
 m will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot wil
 l be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spo
 ts remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registr
 ants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the sta
 rt time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/gross-science-lancaster-
 parks-200919
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
