SUMMARY:Live Music with The Mystic Alpacas at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us on select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nWith backgrounds in jazz\, blues\, rock\, Motown and soul\, The Mystic Alpacas deliver. Their repertoire includes songs from the last five decades. All genres of music! They’ll get you moving. And singing along\, too. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
