UID:10052933-1791055800-1791064800@lancasterpa.com
SUMMARY:Itzhak Perlman with Rohan De Silva at American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Renowned as one of the greatest violinists of all time\, Itzhak Perlman brings extraordinary artistry\, warmth\, and joy to audiences around the world. A true icon of classical music\, Perlman has performed with every major orchestra and in the world’s most celebrated concert halls\, earning 16 GRAMMY® Awards\, multiple Emmy Awards\, a Kennedy Center Honor\, and the Presidential Medal of Freedom. \nIn addition to his celebrated orchestral appearances\, Perlman continues to captivate audiences through special programs and intimate recitals alongside longtime collaborator Rohan De Silva. A passionate advocate for music education\, he and his wife Toby founded the Perlman Music Program\, helping to mentor and inspire the next generation of musicians. \nWhether performing beloved classics or exploring new works\, Perlman’s unmatched musicianship and enduring passion make every performance an unforgettable experience. \nAcclaimed pianist Rohan De Silva is widely recognized as one of the leading collaborative artists of his generation. Known for his sensitivity\, precision\, and expressive depth\, De Silva has performed on the world’s most prestigious stages alongside many of today’s greatest instrumentalists. \nA longtime collaborator of Itzhak Perlman\, De Silva brings a refined musical partnership that enhances every performance with nuance and balance. His artistry has been praised for its elegance and versatility\, seamlessly supporting and elevating the soloist while shining in his own right. \nTogether\, De Silva and Perlman create an extraordinary concert experience\, blending technical mastery with heartfelt musical connection. \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/itzhak-perlman-american-music-theatre/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Highway East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Concert,Entertainment,Live Music,Musical Events,Route 30
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/american-music-theatre-event-itzhak-perlman.webp
GEO:40.0248492;-76.2005132
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=American Music Theatre 2425 Lincoln Highway East Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2425 Lincoln Highway East:geo:-76.2005132,40.0248492
END:VEVENT
