 -picnic-ride-40r-2/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/mtcp-advance
 d-picnic-ride-40r-2/)\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring w
 ater and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator)
 .\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Clu
 b membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup d
 oes not mean you are a club member.\nJoin here [Member Signup](https://www
