SUMMARY:Night Owls
DESCRIPTION:Night Owls  \nFriday October 9th\, 2026\, 5:00 – 8:00 PM  \nExperience an evening of science and discovery after dark at the Lancaster Science Factory.  \nExplore the Science Factory\, enjoy special owl-themed activities\, and learn all about these fascinating nocturnal animals.  \nLive Owl Presentations  \nPresented by Raven Ridge Wildlife Center  \nJoin us for a special live owl presentation featuring Horus and Khonsu.  \nShowtimes:  \n\n5:30 PM \n\n\n6:15 PM \n\n\n7:00 PM \n\nOwl presentation tickets are $3 per person in addition to general admission. Lancaster Science Factory members receive 10% off the owl presentation ticket.  \nSpace is limited\, so advance tickets are recommended.  \nMore Owl Activities  \nThroughout the evening\, enjoy additional owl-themed activities included with your admission.  \nOwl Pellet Investigation\nDiscover what an owl has been eating by examining real owl pellets and uncovering the clues inside.  \nScience Café\nGet hands-on with real owl specimens and discover how wings\, feet\, and skulls help owls survive and thrive.  \nPlus\, explore all of your favorite Lancaster Science Factory exhibits throughout the evening.  \nGeneral admission is required to attend Night Owls. Owl presentation tickets are sold separately. 
URL:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/night-owls/
LOCATION:The Lancaster Science Factory\, 454 New Holland Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/wp-content/uploads/Night-Owls-Banner-2026.png
GEO:40.0461822;-76.2963319
