 pe into an adorable seasonal pumpkin. We’ll provide all the essential cr
 afting ingredients\, so you can customize your keepsake with your child’
 s name and the year. Registration is required to make sure we supply enoug
 h dough!Note for parents: Salt dough requires time to fully dry or bake. P
 articipants will take their molded creations home with clear instructions 
 on how to easily bake or air-dry and seal their pumpkins to ensure they la
 st for years to come!
