 on\, fun\, chaos and story. Play as a character you create and let the Dun
 geon Master take you on a journey to a mystical land. Cast spells\, talk t
 o and befriend NPCs. Everything is possible as long as you can roll the di
 ce. New players are welcome! No prior experience needed. You must be regis
 tered to attend. We will be using the 5th edition of Dungeons and Dragons 
 (2014 Rules). Ages 18+.
