SUMMARY:Family Movie Matinee
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T160000
UID:ac62784712b6c0ddf309589bc20d3ff2@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Movie & Film\, Everyone\n\nGather your favorite little monster
 s and join us for a fang-tastic afternoon at the movies! We are hosting a 
 special family matinee screening of the hilarious\, animated hit\, Hotel T
 ransylvania (rated PG).Step inside Count Dracula’s lavish five-stake res
 ort\, where monsters can kick back and be themselves without any pesky hum
 ans around. But when an ordinary human backpacker accidentally stumbles in
 to the hotel and falls for Dracula's daughter\, Mavis\, the Count must go 
 into overdrive to hide the uninvited guest! It’s a wildly energetic\, za
 ny\, and heartwarming comedy about family\, acceptance\, and letting your 
 hair down. Snacks will be provided\, but you are also welcome to bring you
 r own favorite movie treats! Patrons are encouraged to bring blankets or p
 illows to get extra comfortable during the show! No registration required!
LOCATION:Eastern Lancaster County\, NHD Activity Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/family-movie-matinee-202
 605
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
