SUMMARY:Parachute Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261012T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261012T104500
UID:ef1b6fc7437976cf481ff4f17c8d573a@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (Mus
 t be 18 months-younger 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is re
 quired)Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Ple
 ase add any additional registrants to your registration if more than one c
 hild that will be participating in the program.Registration will open at 9
 :00AM on Wednesday\, September 30th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter
  residents and on Friday\, October 2nd for residents of other municipaliti
 es.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registrat
 ion for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from re
 gistering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please c
 ancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the progra
 m to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in
  registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to t
 he start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The 
 program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your sp
 ot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. 
 If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, r
 egistrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the s
 tart time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults and children 
 to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your child. D
 rop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prio
 r to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.Program L
 imits - Patrons are limited to one session of multiple session programs pe
 r week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-169387
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
