BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/ghosts-monsters-and-tales-adventure-uncharted-lancaster-194302"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Ghosts\, Monsters\, and Tales of Adventure with Uncharted Lancaste
 r
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T194500
UID:1824ca54da1a6e8cfe3422e21e3fd00e@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nAre you brave e
 nough to explore the haunted corners of Lancaster County? Join Uncharted L
 ancaster founder and local historian Adam Zurn for an evening of eerie leg
 ends\, mysterious happenings\, and true tales of the unexplained. This eve
 nt promises a thrilling blend of history and the supernatural that will le
 ave you glancing over your shoulder on the walk back to your car. From bat
 tlefields to backroads\, Lancaster County’s long history hides more than
  a few restless spirits. In the Ghosts\, Monsters\, and Tales of Adventure
  presentation\, Adam shares some of his favorite stories from his recent b
 ook of the same name. The presentation combines historical research\, eyew
 itness accounts\, and local folklore to reveal how the past still echoes t
 hrough the present.Prepare to meet long-dead soldiers\, vengeful spirits\,
  and mysterious creatures that haunt the river valleys and hollow hills of
  the Susquehanna region. Some stories may chill your bones\, while others 
 will spark your sense of wonder at just how deep Lancaster’s legends run
 .
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center B
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/ghosts-monsters-and-tale
 s-adventure-uncharted-lancaster-194302
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
