 the Adamstown Area Library. Through compelling photographs\, audio recordi
 ngs\, eyewitness accounts\, and video evidence\, Eric will share fascinati
 ng stories from his investigations of haunted locations\, UFO sightings\, 
 mysterious creatures\, and other paranormal phenomena. Discover the techni
 ques used by investigators\, hear about remarkable encounters from across 
 Pennsylvania and beyond\, and participate in a lively audience Q&A session
 . Whether you’re a skeptic\, a believer\, or simply curious about the un
 known\, this entertaining and thought-provoking presentation offers a uniq
 ue look into the world of paranormal investigation. This program is for ad
 ults\, and registration is required.
