 8-29) with differing abilities\, as well as their friends\, family\, careg
 ivers\, and guests. For this meeting of Sean's Social Club\, we will be ho
 sting a Halloween Bash! We will be watching a Halloween movie\, painting m
 ini pumpkins\, and enjoying the festivities. Costumes encouraged! Registra
 tion is required for this meeting so that we have enough supplies for pump
