UID:3448274e18e1a39bf5f0dc444fc3663d@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nGet ready to level up your r
 oom decor for Halloween! Join us for the ultimate cozy-but-creepy craftern
 oon where we are making dazzling\, 4x6 diamond art acrylic masterpieces.If
  you love paint-by-numbers\, pixel art\, or just satisfying DIYs\, this is
  your vibe. You will use a special stylus to place sparkling resin rhinest
 ones onto a sticky piece of acrylic\, watching a spooky design come to lif
 e one gem at a time. We will have different aesthetic patterns to choose f
 rom\, including jack-o'-lanterns\, a witch silhouette with a black cat\, o
 r a spider on a web (while supplies last\, you cannot pick which design yo
 u want ahead of time). Fuel your creativity with provided seasonal treats 
 and refreshments or feel free to bring your own! Recommended for ages 12-1
 8! Registration is required!All Premium Supplies Included: acrylic canvas\
 , rhinestones\, wax\, and diamond pens!
