DESCRIPTION:Presentation\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\n\
 nLieutenant General James Longstreet has been blamed for the loss at Getty
 sburg. In this presentation\, we will examine Longstreet's role at Gettysb
 urg and the accusations made against him by fellow soldiers\, to find that
  these accusations held no truth.Presented by Cindy Beaston\, Founder of t
 he General Welsh Post 118: Columbia Civil War Roundtable.
