SUMMARY:Autumn Uncorked: trick or treat in the vineyard
DESCRIPTION:After a year off\, we are excited to be bringing back our fall Trick or treat event – this year named “Autumn Uncorked”\nJoin us for an afternoon that both adults and children can enjoy\, with wagon rides through the vineyard\, wine tasting for adults\, candy for kids\, balloon twisting\, face painting\, yard games\, hot beverages\, food\, and fun! We’ll have live music 1-4pm\, so bring your lawn chairs and blankets for an afternoon of fun on the lawn.\n\nAdvanced tickets required and available online or in the tasting room until 10/15. [Adults $15 / Children $8].\nClick Here to Purchase Tickets\n\nAll children must be accompanied by an adult.Costumes encouraged\, but not required.\nFood truck (Nano Burgers) will be onsite. Wine and beer will be available for purchase. No outside alcohol or pets allowed.\n[Rain date 10/25. No refunds]
