BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-201804"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-169388"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Parachute Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T104500
UID:10c651e7deaff83a30bf584341c1650a@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (Mus
 t be 18 months-younger 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is re
 quired)Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Ple
 ase add any additional registrants to your registration if more than one c
 hild that will be participating in the program.Registration will open at 9
 :00AM on Wednesday\, October 7th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter re
 sidents and on Friday\, October 9th for residents of other municipalities.
 Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration
  for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from regis
 tering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please canc
 el your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program t
 o allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in re
 gistration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the 
 start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The pro
 gram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot 
 will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If 
 spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, regi
 strants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the star
 t time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults and children to 
 enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop
  offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior t
 o departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.Program Limi
 ts - Patrons are limited to one session of multiple session programs per w
 eek.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-169388
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
