UID:1c829c432d30e4301c8a5b5b53ce0527@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Children\n\nLancaster Science Factory Presents- Forces 
 at Play STEM ProgramExperience physics you can feel! Why does a balloon ro
 cket zoom forward when the air rushes out the back? In this action-packed 
 program\, students explore Newton’s Third Law of Motion: for every actio
 n\, there is an equal and opposite reaction\, by building and testing thei
 r own balloon-powered rocket systems.For Children ages 9-13 -Children must
  meet the age requirement.*Great for Homeschool students!
LOCATION:Strasburg-Heisler
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/lancaster-science-factor
 y-stem-program-203091
