BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-adult-services-program-205571"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Decoding the Deck\, Part 2: A Deep Dive into the Major Arcana
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T194500
UID:457ff1028d12e3339b3d7d85916a6564@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\n🎨 Decoding the Deck\, Pa
 rt 2: A Deep Dive into the Major Arcana 🔮Ready to take your Tarot knowl
 edge to the next level? Join us for Part 2 of our educational Tarot series
  with local instructor Theresa from @claritymindretreat! 🃏✨This time\
 , we’re doing a deep dive into the 22 Major Arcana cards-- often known i
 n art and literature as "The Fool’s Journey." Whether you attended Part 
 1 or are just jumping in now\, this session will give you a much deeper ap
 preciation for the visual storytelling hidden in the deck. 🎨🏛️What
  we'll cover:🃏 The Fool’s Journey: The narrative arc connecting the 2
 2 Major Arcana cards.🏛️ Universal Archetypes: The history and symboli
 sm behind iconic cards like The Empress\, The Lovers\, and The World.👁
 ️‍🗨️ Visual Storytelling: How Renaissance art\, allegory\, and my
 th shaped the imagery we see today.Whether you're looking to decode your o
 wn deck or just love a fascinating deep-dive into art history\, this class
  is for you! 📚✍️⚠️ Please note: This presentation is strictly e
 ducational and focused entirely on history\, art\, and symbolism. No live 
 readings will be conducted!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-adult-services-
 program-205571
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
