 \n\nEver wonder how math can make the impossible look easy? Join us for an
  interactive\, mind-bending session with local mathemagician Doc Yoder!In 
 this workshop\, you’ll witness incredible illusions—from predicting se
 cret cards using mathematical patterns to mind-reading feats and surprisin
 g card tricks. But we won't just leave you guessing: Doc Yoder will pull b
 ack the curtain on "The Mystery Card" to reveal how simple numbers\, multi
 ples\, and a stacked deck create unforgettable magic.Whether you're a curi
 ous beginner\, a puzzle enthusiast\, or just love a good trick\, you’ll 
 leave with hands-on tricks to practice and perform for your friends and fa
 mily.No advanced math skills required—just bring your curiosity!
