DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nSpecial Storytime with Manh
 eim Township Fire RescueOctober is Fire Safety Awareness month. Join us Fr
 iday\, October 23rd at 10:30am in the Morgan Center for a fun and educatio
 nal storytime event with a real-life hero! The Manheim Township Fire and R
 escue crew will be our special guest at the library to read stories about 
 firefighters\, fire safety\, and community helpers.In addition to the stor
 ytime\, kids will learn important fire safety tips\, see real firefighter 
 gear up close\, and ask questions about what it’s like to be a firefight
 er. There may even be an opportunity to see the fire truck up close. This 
 event is perfect for families with young children who want to learn about 
 staying safe in a fun and interactive way. This event is recommended for c
 hildren of all ages.The participation of the firefighters is dependent upo
 n any emergency situation which may arise and call them away. The storytim
 e will happen with plenty of fun stories and activities even if they are c
 alled away. We will attempt to reschedule the firefighters if their schedu
 le permits.Please register for each child that will be attending the event
  so that we have adequate supplies for everyone. Parents and caregivers do
  not need to register.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, Octo
 ber 7th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, O
 ctober 9th for residents of other municipalities.STORYTIME POLICIES:No Sho
 w – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library
  programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future progra
 ms for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at
  least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the
  waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.Late A
 rrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to 
 allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly
  at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to tho
 se on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registran
 ts may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be perm
 itted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adul
 ts – This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please p
 lan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permit
 ted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify th
 at the program has not been cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center AB
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/special-fire-safety-stor
 ytime-deputy-chief-borry-manheim-township-fire-and-rescue-134936
