X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Bird In Hand": "https://bird-in-hand.com/event/hammer-creek-bluegrass/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bird_in_hand
X-SOURCE:Bird-in-Hand
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T210000
DTSTAMP:20260824T125902Z
CREATED:20260824T125753Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260824T125902Z
UID:10001067-1792782000-1792789200@bird-in-hand.com
SUMMARY:Hammer Creek Bluegrass
DESCRIPTION:ONE SHOW ONLY — OCTOBER 23\, 2026\nWhether you’re a die-hard bluegrass fan or simply looking for a night of great live music\, Hammer Creek delivers the timeless songs of simpler days. Their music takes you back to the roots of bluegrass\, honoring legendary pioneers like Flatt & Scruggs\, The Stanley Brothers and Bill Monroe. With driving banjo\, heartfelt harmonies\, and that unmistakable high lonesome sound\, they bring this traditional American musical genre to life one song at a time. \nBased in Lancaster County\, Hammer Creek was formed in 2020 and have played shows throughout Pennsylvania\, Maryland and surrounding areas\, including the Buck Moon Bluegrass Festival\, the Appalachian Trail Music Festival and Fort Hunter Days. They have thrice been nominated for the Central Pennsylvania Music Award as Best Bluegrass Band. \nJoin us for a wholesome evening of traditional tunes and masterful musicianship. \nClick here for tickets.
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/hammer-creek-bluegrass/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Stage\, 2760 Old Philadelphia Pike #A\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HammerCreekHeader.jpg
GEO:40.0380988;-76.174466
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Bird-in-Hand Stage 2760 Old Philadelphia Pike #A Bird-in-Hand PA 17505 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2760 Old Philadelphia Pike #A:geo:-76.174466,40.0380988
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Mickeysblackbox": "https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/yacht-lobsters/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:mickeysblackbox
X-SOURCE:Mickey's Black Box
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T223000
DTSTAMP:20261003T010232
CREATED:20260730T140206Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260731T142009Z
UID:10000818-1792782000-1792794600@mickeysblackbox.com
SUMMARY:Yacht Lobsters
DESCRIPTION:Friday October 23rd\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $37.25 + Fees\nReserved Riser Seating | $47.95 + Fees\nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $47.95 + Fees \n+$3.50 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Big Fan Presents\n—————————————————\nEstablished 2022 in New York City\, the Yacht Lobsters sail the waves of the butteriest Soft Rock of the 70’s and early 80’s.  Their big sound recreates – and at times reimagines – the studio mastery of retro-rock icons like Steely Dan\, the Doobie Brothers\, Hall & Oates\, Toto\, etc.  \nIt’s the breezy Yacht Rock cool vibe you know and love\, fused with stellar vocals\, a full horn section and unique elements of NOLA funk\, classic rock and jazz improvisation to keep things bouncy\, set your mood to festive and ensure your boat’s a-rockin’.  There’s even a tasteful smattering of original music that sounds like it stepped right out of 1978. \nFounded by the visionary team behind Brother Joscephus and the Love Revolution\, the Lobster roster features NYC’s finest professional musicians who have played together for decades. \nGrab your captain’s hat\, make that Pina Colada a double and climb aboard! \nCheck out Yacht Lobsters here!\nWebsite | Instagram | Facebook\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/yacht-lobsters/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-July-28-2026-at-11.11.03-e1785271587229.jpeg
END:VEVENT
