DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261024T103000
UID:1ede5fb0298240094f0ad604cbbb1848@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nBring the whole family to t
 he library for a delightful storytime experience! Perfect for children age
 s 0-12\, this program features engaging stories\, lively songs\, and fun a
 ctivities designed to spark a love of reading and learning. This is a wond
 erful opportunity for families to bond\, build literacy skills\, and creat
 e lasting memories together!Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT 
 need to register. Please add any additional registrants to your registrati
 on if more than one child that will be participating in the program.Regist
 ration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, October 7th for Manheim Township
  and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, October 9th for residents of 
 other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to canc
 el their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be 
 restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one month
 ’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the 
 start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified
  of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10
  minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other 
 circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At 
 this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will
  be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the p
 rogram. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5
  minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for a
 dults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged
  with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please ch
 eck your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not been 
 cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/family-story-time-169942
