 ard-winning social deduction game full of mystery\, murder and everything 
 in between! Players will be assigned different roles with unique skills an
 d goals. Are you good at bluffing? Will you survive the night? Join us to 
 find out. New players are welcome. This game requires communication so com
 e prepared to talk to each other. Ages 18+
LOCATION:Ephrata\, EPH Multipurpose Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/blood-clock-tower-192089
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
