DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nSmall books. Big conversations
 . 2nd Saturdays (usually!) from 2:30-3:30. Most book clubs are a marathon-
 - this is a sprint! We exclusively read books under 300 pages: perfect for
  the busy reader who wants all the discussion without the 500-page commitm
 ent. Join us for sharp conversation that's short\, sweet\, and gets straig
 ht to the point!June 13: The Heart in Winter by Kevin Barry July 11: Conve
 nience Store Woman by Sayaka Murata August 8: The Employees by Olga Ravn S
 eptember 12: The Most by Jessica Anthony October 24: Comfort Me with Apple
 s by Catherynne M. Valente November 14: Thornhedge by T. Kingfisher Decemb
 er 12: Clear by Carys Davies
