BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-program-195825"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:The Treachery of Botany: Poisonous Garden Plants
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261026T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261026T194500
UID:112d6e235f179503b0a0dcce7c3ad0f5@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\n
 🌿 BEAUTY OR BANE? THE SECRET LIFE OF YOUR GARDEN 💀Vibrant lavender a
 nd mauve blossoms sway in the breeze while butterflies dip and dance above
 . With every rustle of foliage\, delicate white buds flash in the sunlight
 . It’s the ultimate dream landscape—an idyllic\, peaceful sanctuary de
 signed for pure relaxation.But look closer. Hidden within this botanical p
 aradise\, unexpected danger might be lurking right in plain sight.Is that 
 vivid red berry harmless or a hazard?What secret is that unusual violet fl
 ower stalk hiding?Could your pet's favorite sunbathing spot be surrounded 
 by toxic greenery?Uncover the truth behind the beauty! Join speakers Cynth
 ia Trussell\, Indigo Bowser\, and Kathy Vu of the Penn State Master Garden
 ers for The Treachery of Botany: Poisonous Garden Plants. In this eye-open
 ing 45-minute presentation (followed by a Q&A session)\, you'll learn how 
 to identify ordinary\, uncommon\, cultivated\, and wild poisonous plants i
 n your landscape-- discover what makes them tick\, and master easy\, pract
 ical ways to manage them safely.Keep your loved ones safe while keeping yo
 ur sanctuary gorgeous. Don't miss it-- turn your garden into a true\, worr
 y-free paradise!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center B
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-program-195825
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/swoon-squad-romance-tbr-book-club-176855"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Swoon Squad: A Romance TBR Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261026T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261026T200000
UID:4a36334933057a87b5584b90ea0478c5@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nSwoon Squad is a romance-cente
 red book club with a twist. Instead of everyone reading the same assigned 
 title\, we choose a monthly trope and invite you to pick any book that fit
 s the theme! Whether you're into sweet contemporary rom-coms\, high-heat h
 istorical reads\, or paranormal romance\, there's a seat for you at our ta
 ble! How it Works: Pick Your Own Adventure: We announce the month's trope\
 , and you choose a book from your own TBR pile or the library shelves that
  features it. Low Pressure\, High Fun: No more scrambling to finish a spec
 ific book you might not even like. Read at your own pace and bring your ho
 nest thoughts! The Discussion: We gather to swap recommendations\, vent ab
 out our favorite (and least favorite) clichés\, and discover new authors 
 through each other's picks.Come ready to share your pick\, discuss the tro
 pes\, and meet fellow romance fans in a comfortable library setting ❤️
 June 29 - ⚔️Enemies to Lovers ⚔️July 27 - 🥰😠Grumpy/Sunshine
 😠🥰August 31 - 🏆Sports Romance🏆September 28 - 📖Academic Roma
 nce📖October 26 - 🧛Paranormal Romance🧛November 30 - 🛏️Forced 
 Proximity🛏️December 28 - 🎁Holiday Romance🎁
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/swoon-squad-romance-tbr-
 book-club-176855
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
