SUMMARY:Chills\, Thrills and that Spooky Stuff: Horror of the Early '60s w
 ith Kevin Stairiker!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261028T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261028T200000
UID:643b62830335cafb6de3b0fa3238be26@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Discussion\, Movie & Film\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nWhat keeps you
  up at night? 🌙 Horror movies have been trying to crack that spooky cod
 e for over a century! Styles may change\, but a classic jump-scare can sti
 ll creep out a fresh generation of moviegoers. 🎬This October\, test you
 r brave side with us! 🎃 Every Tuesday night starting at 6pm\, we’re s
 creening legendary fright flicks that have given movie lovers the wiggles\
 , the willies\, and full-blown goosebumps for decades. 🍿 Hosted by Kevi
 n Stairiker (LNP | LancasterOnline)\, each evening packs in creepy cinema\
 , post-movie chats\, light snacks\, and maximum eerie vibes. 🕷️ Bring
  your courage (and a friend to hide behind)! 👀✨October 5th: City of t
 he Dead\, 1960\, 78 minutesOctober 20th: Black Sabbath\, 1963\, 93 minutes
 October 28th: The Innocents\, 1961\, 100 minutesRegistration is encouraged
 !
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center B
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/chills-thrills-and-spook
 y-stuff-horror-early-60s-kevin-stairiker-203080
