 stration & Time Slots:Please be advised that this wave will have two start
  times—5:30pm and 5:38pm. Participants will be accommodated on a first-c
 ome\, first-served basis within that wave. Please arrive early to allow fo
 r parking. This system ensures everyone has a chance to join the fun while
  keeping the trail safe and organized. Important Details:Registration is r
 equired. Please register each child attending—do not register adults.Sug
 gested ages: 1–8 yearsOne Wave Only: To give as many families as possibl
