SUMMARY:Parachute Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T104500
UID:d1d46bd634f5a86b31ebc2be5f3c3de3@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (For
  safety reasons\, children must not be younger than 18 months or older tha
 n 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is required)Adults attendi
 ng with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additiona
 l registrants to your registration if more than one child that will be par
 ticipating in the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, 
 October 28th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Frida
 y\, October 30th for residents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesN
 o Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 li
 brary programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future p
 rograms for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registratio
 ns at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those o
 n the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.L
 ate Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the progra
 m to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin pro
 mptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited t
 o those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, regi
 strants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be
  permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying
  Adults – This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Ple
 ase plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be p
 ermitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to veri
 fy that the program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are li
 mited to one session of multiple session programs per week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-169431
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
