DESCRIPTION:Health & Wellness\, Babies\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nAt the Lib
 rary we celebrate literacy every day! A special way we do this fall is by 
 having therapy dogs visit us! We will create a calm environment for the tr
 ained therapy dogs and their handler\, as well as for the children\, as we
  understand they may have some pet centric fears. This program is a more l
 aid-back version of story time where the children will be educated on how 
 to approach the pups and will be given time to warm up to them while we re
 ad different doggie themed stories. Ages 3-5.
