DESCRIPTION:Community\, Adults\, Seniors\, Everyone\n\nAre you facing chal
 lenges or seeking support in your life? A licensed social worker from REAL
  Life Community Services is here to help! Regular hours are every other We
 dnesday from 11:30-2 p.m. in the library community room. To make an appoin
 tment\, call Becca at 717-336-7797 or email her at becca@reallcs.org. REAL
  Life Community Services serves residents of Cocalico School District.
