X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/lpl-open-late-first-friday-152913"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:LPL Open Late: First Friday
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T200000
UID:b6bff2c5d6cae05ffad0dd703841193a@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Everyone\n\nMake Lancaster Public Library a stop o
 n your First Friday culture crawl!Downtown Lancaster springs to life on th
 e First Friday of each month. Art galleries\, studios\, museums\, restaura
 nts\, shops\, and attractions in downtown Lancaster stay open late while p
 eople head out to enjoy the festive atmosphere\, dining\, art\, and entert
 ainment.Stop by the library to check out some books\, browse the Juliana B
 ookstore\, or find a quiet spot to sit and take it all in. We're open unti
 l 8PM on the following First Fridays:May 1June 5August 7September 4October
