DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nCelebrate the holiday seaso
 n with a fun-filled event featuring stories\, songs\, crafts\, and a visit
  from Santa himself!📖 What to Expect:Storytime: Gather around as our Yo
 uth Services staff reads their favorite holiday stories including Twas' th
 e Night Before Christmas.🎵 Holiday Sing-Along: Sing festive songs to ge
 t everyone in the holiday spirit!🎨 Craft Time: Create a special holiday
  craft to take home.📸 Photos with Santa: Capture the magic with a keeps
 ake photo of your little one with Santa.Adults attending with their child(
 ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additional registrants to you
 r registration if more than one child that will be participating in the pr
 ogram.This event is free\, and all materials for crafts will be provided. 
