DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Adults\, Seniors\n\n18 and up\; please register - dro
 p ins will be accommodated as space permits. Please note that we require a
  minimum number of registered players to hold this program so monitor your
  email in case it is cancelled.Join a volunteer-led gang who love to play 
 games together! Meet in the main library (tables behind the magazines) and
  have some fun learning a new game or showing your skills if you're alread
