DESCRIPTION:Community\, Everyone\n\nPA 211 staff will provide easily acces
 sible walk-up assistance in the library's front lobby.  Assistance include
 s information and referrals for a broad range of services: childcare\, aft
 er-school programs\, food banks\, elder care\, basic needs\, health servic
 es\, and more. PA 211 staff can also provide housing and homelessness inta
 ke screenings for residents of Berks and Lancaster counties.Monday\, Wedne
 sday\, Thursday: 9am-5pmFirst Thursday: 9am-3:30pm
