CREATED:20260902T130506Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T130506Z
UID:38595-1805036400-1805040000@apostlesucc.org
SUMMARY:Apostles Academy Concert: Lars Potteiger Organ Trio
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an afternoon of jazz with the Lars Potteiger Organ Trio\, featuring the rich\, soulful sound of the jazz organ. This lively performance will bring together groove\, improvisation\, and the energy of live jazz for an afternoon of music in the Sanctuary. Mark your calendar for Sunday\, March 14\, 2027\, at 3 PM!
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/apostles-academy-concert-lars-potteiger-organ-trio/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Lars-Potteiger-Organ-Trio-Concert-3.14.27.jpg
END:VEVENT
