BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancastersciencefactory": "https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/girl-scout-badge-workshops-robotics/2027-03-20/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancastersciencefactory
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Science Factory
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270320T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270320T160000
DTSTAMP:20261003T010222
CREATED:20260804T141923Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804T142514Z
UID:10003267-1805549400-1805558400@lancastersciencefactory.org
SUMMARY:Girl Scout Badge Workshops (Robotics)
DESCRIPTION:Badge Workshops for Daisies through Juniors\nThe Lancaster Science Factory is pleased to offer an expanded menu of Girl Scout workshops designed to educate\, challenge\, and empower scouts while completing badge requirements. \nWorkshops are 1 hour unless otherwise noted. Register a single scout or the whole troop for upcoming workshops listed below. \n  \nRobotics Badge Workshops\nLearn all about robotics with our hands-on Robotics Badge workshops! All workshops cover the Robotics Badge 1 for each troop level. \nRobotics workshops will be offered on the following dates: \nSaturday\, October 17\, 2026\n–Daisies and Brownies from 1:30-2:30 pm (register here) \n–Juniors from 3-4 pm (register here) \nSaturday\, December 12\, 2026\n–Daisies and Brownies from 1:30-2:30 pm (register here) \n–Juniors from 3-4 pm (register here) \nSaturday\, March 20\, 2027\n–Daisies and Brownies from 1:30-2:30 pm (register here) \n–Juniors from 3-4 pm (register here) \n  \nCan’t make it to a scheduled workshop? Reach out to Megan Stoltzfus at mstoltzfus@tlsf.org to schedule a private workshop. Availability is limited for private workshops\, so we recommend scheduling ahead by a minimum of 1-2 months if possible.\nProgram attendance\, cancellation\, and refund policy.\n\nCancellations (by the registrant) received less than one week prior to the workshop will be subject to a refund of 1/2 of the total registration cost for that workshop. Cancellations received prior to that shall receive a full refund.\nWorkshops canceled by the Lancaster Science Factory for ANY reason will be refunded fully.\n\n 
URL:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/girl-scout-badge-workshops-robotics/2027-03-20/
LOCATION:The Lancaster Science Factory\, 454 New Holland Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/wp-content/uploads/Girl-Scout-Badge-Workshops-1920-x-1080-px.png
GEO:40.0461822;-76.2963319
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Lancaster Science Factory 454 New Holland Ave Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=454 New Holland Ave:geo:-76.2963319,40.0461822
END:VEVENT
